                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabona kuti taakwe muntu, wakagamba nkaambo kakuti taakwe uulibusya kubamba makani, elyo kuboko kwakwe mwini kwakamufutula, abululami bwakwe bwakamutabilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.16",
