        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo bantu bazwa kububbila bayoolemeka izina lya-Jehova, abaabo bali kubuzwezuba bayooyoowa bulemu bwakwe, nkaambo uyoosika mbuli mulonga uupoomoka nguubinzya muuwo wa-Jehova. ",
